---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Projects — Prajakta Shevakari">
  <section>
    <h1 style="font-weight:900;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:.2px;margin-bottom:12px">Projects</h1>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="font-weight:700">D-FuseSmileNet — Multimodal Transformer for Spontaneous Smile Recognition</h3>
        <p style="color:#d1d5db">Transformer-based multimodal network fusing handcrafted facial-action features with learned embeddings to distinguish <strong>spontaneous vs. posed smiles</strong>; achieved <strong>state-of-the-art accuracy</strong> on benchmark datasets.</p>
        <p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:14px">Stack: Python • PyTorch • Transformers</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/pshevak/prajaktashevakari/tree/e72b80fb99601047c2ddd1371f9cbee195e6255c/D-FuseSmileNet%20-%20Deep%20Learning%20for%20Spontaneous%20Smile%20Recognition">Report</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="font-weight:700">Clinical NER (LLMs + Chain-of-Thought)</h3>
        <p style="color:#d1d5db">Prompt-engineered LLM pipeline combining <strong>few-shot</strong> + <strong>chain-of-thought</strong> to auto-label <strong>Bengali clinical text</strong>, producing synthetic annotations that <strong>boosted downstream NER performance by 30%+</strong>.</p>
        <p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:14px">Stack: Python • Transformers • NLP • Prompting</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://github.com/pshevak/prajaktashevakari/tree/e72b80fb99601047c2ddd1371f9cbee195e6255c/Clinical%20NER%20with%20LLMs%20and%20Chain-of-Thought%20Prompting">Report</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
